[F]He will come [Bb7]in the clouds [Eb]of His Father's
[Bb]bright glory [F7]but we know [Bb]not the hour.

Verse 2:
[F7]There's [Bb]light for [F]the wise [F7]who are [Bb]seeking salvation;
[F]There's truth [F7]in the [Eb]book of [Bb]the Lord's revelation;
[F]Each prophecy [Bb7]points to [Eb]the great comsummation
[Bb]But we [F7]know not [Bb]the hour.

Verse 3:
[F7]We'll watch [Bb]and we'll [F]pray, with [F7]our lamps [Bb]trimmed and burning;
[F]We'll work [F7]and we'll [Eb]wait till [Bb]the Master's returning;
[F]We'll sing [Bb7]and rejoice, [Eb]every omen discerning
[Bb]But we [F7]know not [Bb]the hour.
